                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12676' id='1333' type-v2='text' w='99200' x='400' y='5016'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Month-to-Date (MoTD) and Year-over-Year-to-Date (YoYTD):</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Condition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: When the </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#df1067' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Reporting Month</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> is the </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#df1067' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>current month</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Example</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: If today&apos;s date is September 9, 2024, the comparative periods for Month-over-Month (MoM) will be from August 1 to August 9, 2024. For Year-over-Year (YoY), the comparative period will be from September 1 to September 9, 2023.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Month-over-Month (MoM) and Year-over-Year (YoY):</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Condition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: When the </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#df1067' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Reporting Month</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> is not the </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#df1067' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>current month</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Example</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: If the selected reporting month is August 2024, the comparative period for Month-over-Month (MoM) will be July 2024. For Year-over-Year (YoY), the comparative period will be August 2023.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Use parameters (</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Sort By </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Sort Order</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>) for sorting a KPI!</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
